        <head n="2" source="#source-495-584"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-21" source="#source-516-554">Ⅰ</g></head>
        <p><seg source="#source-586-609">遠い鈴　銀の鈴</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-609-633">何かきこえる</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-633-722"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-22" source="#source-654-692">Ⅱ</g></head>
        <p><seg source="#source-724-753">そつとお祈りすると</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-753-782">金の糸が胸まで届く</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-782-800">ああ　小さな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-800-824"><rb>幸福</rb><rt>さいはひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-824-833">！</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-833-922"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-23" source="#source-854-892">Ⅲ</g></head>
        <p><seg source="#source-924-942">まだ見ぬ少女</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
